---
import { ArrowUpRight } from "../../components/icons";
import Layout from '../../layout/index.astro';
---

 <Layout title="Icone — Terms of Service"
 description="Terms of Service for Icone software products and website."
 >
<div class="min-h-screen bg-brand-dark text-brand-cream pt-32 pb-20 px-4 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <a
        href="/"
          class="group flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-yellow font-bold uppercase text-xs mb-12 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="rotate-180"><ArrowUpRight className="w-4 h-4" /></span>
          Back to Home
      </a>

        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-display uppercase leading-none mb-12">
          Terms of <span class="text-brand-yellow">Service</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="space-y-12 font-sans text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">01.</span> Acceptance of Terms
            </h2>
            <p>
              By accessing our website, downloading, installing, or using any software products or services provided by Icone ("we," "us," or "our"), you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, do not use our website or software products.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">02.</span> Scope of Services
            </h2>
            <p>
              Icone publishes and distributes software products, including desktop applications, SaaS offerings, and developer tools. Access to our products may be provided under various license types (trial, subscription, perpetual, or enterprise) as specified at the point of purchase or in a separate license agreement. We reserve the right to modify, update, or discontinue any product or service at any time, subject to applicable license terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">03.</span> Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p>
              All software, documentation, branding, and content published by Icone are our intellectual property. When you license our software, you receive the rights specified in your license agreement—typically a limited, non-exclusive right to use the software for the licensed purpose. You may not copy, modify, reverse engineer, decompile, or distribute our software except as expressly permitted by your license. We retain all rights not expressly granted to you.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">04.</span> Acceptable Use
            </h2>
            <p>
              You agree to use our software and services only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms. You may not: use our software to violate any law or third-party rights; attempt to circumvent license restrictions or security measures; distribute malware or interfere with our systems; or resell, sublicense, or redistribute our software except as permitted by your license. We may suspend or terminate access for violations of acceptable use.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">05.</span> Confidentiality
            </h2>
            <p>
              Both parties agree to maintain the confidentiality of proprietary information shared during the business relationship. This includes source code, license keys, API credentials, business plans, and other non-public information. We do not share your data with third parties except as described in our Privacy Policy or as required by law.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">06.</span> Limitation of Liability
            </h2>
            <p>
              To the maximum extent permitted by law, Icone shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use our software or services. Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim. Our software is provided "as is" without warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose, except where prohibited by law.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">07.</span> Governing Law
            </h2>
            <p>
              These terms are governed by the laws of the State of New Jersey, United States. Any disputes arising from these terms or your use of our software shall be resolved in the courts located in Pennsauken, NJ. If you have questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@iconeht.com" class="underline text-brand-yellow">contact@iconeht.com</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <div class="pt-12 border-t border-white/10 text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500">
            Last Updated: February 2025
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
 </Layout>